 This package contains the GNU Compiler Collection and GNU binutils with the MorphOS Team's
 patches, built as a cross-compiler for MorphOS. On Debian systems, the complete text of the GNU
 General Public License version 3 can be found in /usr/share/common-licenses/GPL-3.
 .
 The runtime libraries of GCC (libgcc, libstdc++ and the others) are covered by the GCC Runtime
 Library Exception 3.1. GMP is licensed LGPL-3.0-or-later OR GPL-2.0-or-later; MPFR and MPC are
 licensed LGPL-3.0-or-later. The licence texts of the components are in
 /usr/lib/morphos-cross/share/doc/morphos-cross/licenses, the list of components and versions in
 /usr/lib/morphos-cross/share/doc/morphos-cross/THIRD-PARTY.md, and the exact sources in the
 source archive of the release.
 .
 The MorphOS SDK is not part of this package. It belongs to the MorphOS Team, and its own terms
 apply to it once morphos-cross-sdk has installed it.
